OL,3,GNEWSACharity unveils plans for skills  
OL,4,Aand training hub                       
OL,6,FA charity has unveiled plans for a new 
OL,7,Ffacility aimed at creating more        
OL,8,Fopportunities for people with learning 
OL,9,Fdisabilities and autism to learn new   
OL,10,Fskills and gain workplace experience.  
OL,12,FBeresford Street Kitchen, which runs a 
OL,13,Fcafe, catering service and printing    
OL,14,Fbusiness, said the proposed BSK        
OL,15,FExchange in St Helier, Jersey, could   
OL,16,Fexpand its academy, catering and print 
OL,17,Fworks operations.                      
OL,19,FIt said since launching in 2015 it had 
OL,20,Fdelivered more than 11,500 workplace   
OL,21,Ftraining sessions.                     
