OL,3,GNEWSACharity unveils plans for skills  
OL,4,Aand training hub                       
OL,6,FChief executive Gabby Ellmers said: "We
OL,7,Fwant more people to have the           
OL,8,Fopportunities to build confidence,     
OL,9,Fdevelop skills and make choices about  
OL,10,Fwhat comes next for them."             
